<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/Home/index.css" asp-append-version="true" />

<div class="home-container">
	<div class="welcome-message">
		<div class="welcome-hero">

			<div class="welcome-content">
				<h1>
					Welcome to <span>AIRefactor</span>
				</h1>

				<div class="subtitle">
					Your intelligent companion for writing clean,
					maintainable, and high-performance code.
				</div>

				<p class="description">
					AIRefactor helps bridge the gap between functional code
					and robust software design. Learn advanced refactoring
					techniques while receiving intelligent explanations about
					code smells, architectural improvements, and design patterns.
				</p>

				<div class="nav-links">

					<a href="/learn" class="nav-link-btn learn-btn">
						<span class="btn-icon">📘</span>
						Go to Learn
						<span class="arrow">→</span>
					</a>

					<a href="/refactor" class="nav-link-btn refactor-btn">
						<span class="btn-icon">&lt;/&gt;</span>
						Go to Refactor
						<span class="arrow">→</span>
					</a>

				</div>

			</div>

			<div class="welcome-visual">

				<div class="ai-glow"></div>

				<div class="code-window">

					<div class="window-header">
						<span></span>
						<span></span>
						<span></span>
					</div>

					<div class="code-lines">
						<div class="line long"></div>
						<div class="line medium"></div>
						<div class="line short"></div>
						<div class="line medium"></div>
					</div>

					<div class="refactor-arrow">↓</div>

					<div class="clean-code">
						<span>&lt;/&gt;</span>
						<span>✓</span>
					</div>

				</div>

				<div class="ai-chip">
					<div class="chip-face">
						<span></span>
						<span></span>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>

		</div>

		<div id="learn-section" class="learning-section">

			<div class="section-heading">

				<div>
					<span class="section-label">LEARN WITH AI</span>

					<h2>How learning refactoring works</h2>

					<p>
						Understand not only what should change in your code,
						but why the change improves your software.
					</p>
				</div>

			</div>


			<div class="learning-grid">
				<div class="learning-card">

					<div class="feature-icon complexity-icon">
						<div class="cube cube-1"></div>
						<div class="cube cube-2"></div>
						<div class="cube cube-3"></div>
					</div>

					<h3>Deconstruct Complexity</h3>

					<p>
						Break large, difficult functions into clean,
						understandable and testable components.
					</p>

					<span class="technique">
						Extract Method
					</span>

				</div>

				<div class="learning-card">

					<div class="feature-icon pattern-icon">
						<span>⌘</span>
					</div>

					<h3>Optimize Design Patterns</h3>

					<p>
						Learn how architectural improvements and proven
						patterns can solve deeper structural problems.
					</p>

					<span class="technique">
						Better Architecture
					</span>

				</div>

				<div class="learning-card">

					<div class="feature-icon debt-icon">
						<span>⚠</span>
					</div>

					<h3>Reduce Technical Debt</h3>

					<p>
						Identify redundant logic, dead code and performance
						bottlenecks across your application.
					</p>

					<span class="technique">
						Clean Code
					</span>

				</div>

				<div class="learning-card">

					<div class="feature-icon ai-icon">
						<span>&lt;/&gt;</span>
					</div>

					<h3>Contextual AI Explanations</h3>

					<p>
						Understand the reasoning behind every modification
						and build long-term clean-code intuition.
					</p>

					<span class="technique">
						Learn the Why
					</span>

				</div>

			</div>

		</div>

	</div>

	<div class="post-it-note">
		<span class="tip-label">Refactor Tip</span>
		<p id="tip-content">Loading tip...</p>
	</div>
</div>

<script src="~/js/Home/index.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>